<title>INDIA: India's Unitech 96/97 net rises - UNI.</title>
<headline>India's Unitech 96/97 net rises - UNI.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian real estate and construction company Unitech Ltd reported a net profit of 176.3 million rupees for 1996/97 (April-March), up from 164.8 million in 1995/96, the United News of India (UNI) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The news agency said Unitech's board recommended a dividend of 50 percent on its shares compared with 40 percent in the previous year. Turnover rose to 2.72 billion rupees from 2.58 billion, it said.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
